<h2 id=3D"toc-hId-234672159">Conclusion</h2>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>The R Program step extends SAS Data and AI Studio flows by making it eas=
ier to bring R into a visual SAS workflow. In this example, SAS steps prepa=
red the data, R performed additional analysis and visualization, and the re=
sults were returned to SAS for continued use. This approach lets you use R =
where it adds value while keeping the overall process organized and reusabl=
e within SAS.</p>
